# wall — 16x16 vault stone.
#
# Two courses of blocks with a recessed mortar line. The highlight sits on the top-left of each
# block and the shadow on the bottom-right, so the whole grid reads as lit from above-left without
# any actual lighting — which is the only option in M1.
! . = 2b2f4aff   mortar, the darkest tone
! m = 3a3f5eff   block body
! h = 4a5075ff   block highlight, top and left
! s = 232741ff   block shadow, bottom and right
